<title>JAPAN: Arai-Gumi shares slip on report on lower profits.</title>
<headline>Arai-Gumi shares slip on report on lower profits.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Arai-Gumi Ltd slipped on Wednesday morning, depressed by a newspaper report that the construction firm is likely to see a halving of its current profits for the year to December 1996, traders said.</p>
<p>At 0105 GMT, the share price was down 37 yen at 680 yen, making it the ninth-largest percentage loser on the first section of the Tokyo Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
